  "goodToKnow": "Das Sprungbrett is a springboard or diving board, in pools and gyms, and figuratively a stepping stone: ein Sprungbrett in die Politik, ein Sprungbrett für die Karriere. Many German public pools have a Dreimeterbrett and a Zehnmeterturm, and daring to jump from the ten-metre tower is a childhood rite. Der Sprung is a jump, and also a crack in glass. Plural: die Sprungbretter."
